   "source": [
    "### Break Statement\n",
    "Used to terminate the loop when a condition is met.  \n",
    "**Example:** Find prime numbers in a range."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": None,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "lower = int(input(\"enter lower range: \"))\n",
    "upper = int(input(\"enter upper range: \"))\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(lower, upper+1):\n",
    "    for j in range(2, i):\n",
    "        if i % j == 0:\n",
    "            break\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        # The else block of a loop executes if the loop completes without hitting 'break'\n",
    "        print(i)"
   ]
  },
